### ========================================================
### RecipeMate Backend API - REST Client Testing (Tugas 9)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/recipes
### ========================================================

### 1. GET ALL RECIPES (Method: GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/recipes
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. SEARCH & FILTER RECIPES (Method: GET with Query)
GET http://localhost:3000/recipes?search=rendang
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET RECIPE BY ID (Method: GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/recipes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. CREATE RECIPE - SUCCESS (Method: POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ayam Geprek Sambal Korek",
  "description": "Ayam goreng tepung renyah yang digeprek dengan sambal korek pedas gurih khas Solo.",
  "category": "Makan Siang",
  "categories": ["makan-siang", "pedas", "indonesia"],
  "time": 30,
  "servings": 2,
  "difficulty": "Mudah",
  "rating": 4.9,
  "popularity": 92,
  "image": "/images/recipes/ayam-geprek.jpg",
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "group": "Bahan Utama",
      "items": [
        "2 potong dada ayam",
        "1 butir telur",
        "100 gram tepung bumbu serbaguna",
        "Minyak untuk menggoreng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "group": "Sambal Korek",
      "items": [
        "15 buah cabai rawit merah",
        "3 siung bawang putih",
        "1/2 sendok teh garam",
        "3 sendok makan minyak goreng panas"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    "Lumuri ayam dengan sedikit garam dan merica, diamkan 15 menit.",
    "Balur ayam dengan tepung, celupkan ke kocokan telur, balur lagi dengan tepung sambil diremas-remas.",
    "Goreng ayam hingga matang dan renyah keemasan, tiriskan.",
    "Ulek cabai rawit, bawang putih, dan garam kasar-kasar.",
    "Siram sambal dengan minyak goreng yang benar-benar panas.",
    "Letakkan ayam di atas cobek sambal, geprek hingga memar dan sambal merata."
  ],
  "tips": "Siram minyak yang benar-benar mendidih ke atas ulekan sambal untuk aroma yang maksimal.",
  "tags": ["ayam", "pedas", "sambal", "goreng"]
}

###

### 5. CREATE RECIPE - VALIDATION ERROR (Method: POST with invalid data - class-validator test)
POST http://localhost:3000/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "description": "",
  "time": 0,
  "servings": -1,
  "difficulty": "Sangat Sulit"
}

###

### 6. CREATE RECIPE - CONFLICT ERROR (Method: POST duplicate title - ConflictException test)
POST http://localhost:3000/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nasi Goreng Spesial",
  "description": "Deskripsi duplikat",
  "category": "Makan Siang",
  "time": 20,
  "servings": 2,
  "difficulty": "Mudah",
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "group": "Bahan",
      "items": ["Nasi"]
    }
  ],
  "steps": ["Goreng nasi"]
}

###

### 7. GET RECIPE - NOT FOUND (Method: GET with non-existent ID - NotFoundException test)
GET http://localhost:3000/recipes/999999
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. UPDATE RECIPE (Method: PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/recipes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nasi Goreng Spesial Super Pedas",
  "time": 25,
  "difficulty": "Sedang",
  "rating": 5.0
}

###

### 9. DELETE RECIPE (Method: DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/recipes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. VERIFY DELETED RECIPE (Method: GET after delete)
GET http://localhost:3000/recipes/1
Accept: application/json
